{"id":"word:hebrew:H1245","type":"word","title":"בָּקַשׁ","subtitle":"H1245 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"to search out (by any method, specifically in worship or prayer); by implication, to strive after","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to בָּקַשׁ (H1245) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: v.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 225 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"בָּקַשׁ (bâqash) means to search out (by any method, specifically in worship or prayer); by implication, to strive after First listed occurrence: 1Chr 4 39."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"בָּקַשׁ","transliteration":"bâqash","pronunciation":"baw-kash'","strong":"H1245","lemmaId":"hebrew:H1245","partOfSpeech":"v","forms":["מְבַקְשֵׁ֣י","לְ/בַקֵּ֥שׁ","מְבַקֵּ֖שׁ","לְ/בַקֵּ֣שׁ","וַ/יְבַקְשׁוּ֙"],"morphs":[["HR/Vpc",24],["HVprmsa",22],["HVprmpc",19],["HC/Vpw3ms",12],["HVpi3ms",11],["HVpi1cs",10],["HC/Vpw3mp",9],["HVprmpa",9],["HVpp3cp",9],["HVpp3ms",8]]},"definitions":{"short":"to search out (by any method, specifically in worship or prayer); by implication, to strive after","usage":"ask, beg, beseech, desire, enquire, get, make inquisition, procure, (make) request, require, seek (for).","full":"H1245. baqash [ בָּקַשׁ ] 224 verb seek (Phoenician בקש ) — Pi`el Perfect בִּקֵּשׁ Deut 13:11 15 t.; בִּקְשָׁה Eccl 7:28 ; Est 2:15 ; suffix בִּקְשָׁתַם Hosea 2:9 ; בִּקַּשְׁתִּיו Song 3:1-2 , compare 5:6 ; בִּקְשׁוּ Ezra 2:62 12 t.; suffix בִּקְשֻׁנִי Isa 65:1-2 t.; Imperfect יְבַקֵשׁ Josh 22:23 37t.; יְבַקֶּשֿׁ Prov 15:14 2 t.; אֲבַקְשָׁה Psa 122:9 3 t.; suffix יְבַקְשֵׁהוּ 1Sam 23:14 7 t.; יְבַקְשׁוּ 16:16 23 t.; Imperative בַקֵּשׁ 9:3 3 t.; בַּקְּשׁוּ 28:7-8 t.; Infinitive לְבַקֵּשׁ 10:2 29t.; Participle מְבַקֵּשׁ Gen 37:16 23 t.; plural מְבַקְשִׁים Exod 10:11 38t.; — 1 seek to find: a. absolute Judg 6:29 ; 2Kin 2:17 ; Jer 5:1 ; Ezek 34:6 ; Eccl 3:6 ; 8:17 (yet see Ew). b. accusative Gen 37:15-16 , Josh 2:22 (J) Judg 4:22 ; 14:4 ; 1Sam 9:3 ; 10:2 , 14 , 21 ; 16:16 ; 23:14 , 25 ; 24:3 ; 26:2 ; 27:1 , 4 + 26:20 object a flea , but read ᵐ5 נַפְשִׁי Th We Kirkp Klo Dr; 2Sam 17:3 , 20 ; 1Kin 1:3 ; 2:40 ; 18:10 ; 2Kin 2:16 ; 6:19 ; 1Chr 4:39 ; 2Chr 22:9 ; Ezra 2:62 (= Neh 7:64 ) 12:27 ; Psa 37:25 ; 37:36 ; 119:176 ; Prov 2:4 ; 21:6 ; 23:35 ; Proverbs 7:28; Song 3:1 (twice in verse); 3:2 (twice in verse); 5:6 ; 6:1 ; Isa 41:12 , 17 ; Jer 2:24 , 33 ; Lam 1:11 ; Ezek 7:25 ; 22:30 ; 34:4 , 16 ; Hosea 2:9 ; Nahum 3:11 ; Zech 11:16 ; Mal 2:15 . c. with לְ Job 10:6 . d. accusative of thing לְ person Judg 18:1 ; 1Sam 13:14 ; 28:7 ; 1Kin 1:2 ; Ruth 3:1 ; Est 2:2 ; Psa 122:9 ; Isa 40:20 ; Lam 1:19 ; Nahum 3:7 . 2 seek to secure: a. accusative the priesthood Num 16:10 (P); David for king 2Sam 3:17 ; in battle 5:17 (= 1Chr 14:8 ); Psa 27:4 ; Jer 45:5 (compare 45:5 ); נפשׁ בקשׁ seek to take one's life Exod 4:19 (J) 1Sam 20:1 ; 22:23 (twice in verse); 23:15 ; 25:29 ; 2Sam 4:8 ; 16:11 ; 1Kin 19:10 , 14 ; Psa 35:4 ; 38:13 ; 40:15 ; 54:5 ; 63:10 ; 70:3 ; 86:14 ; Prov 29:10 ; Jer 4:30 ; 11:21 ; 19:7 , 9 ; 21:7 ; 22:25 ; 34:20-21 , 38:16 ; 44:30 (twice in verse); 46:26 ; 49:37 . b. aim at, practise: רעה בקשׁ seek hurt of Num 35:23 (P) 1Sam 24:10 ; 25:26 ( אֶל ) 1Kin 20:7 ; Psa 71:13 ; 71:24 ; Est 9:2 ; ׳ב כזב Psa 4:3 compare Prov 17:11 , שׁבר 17:19 , רצון 11:27 , טובה Neh 2:10 , אמונה Jer 5:1 , ענוה צדק, Zeph 2:3 (twice in verse) שׁלום Psa 34:15 , חכמה Prov 14:6 ; Eccl 7:25 , בינה Dan 8:15 , דעת Prov 15:14 ; 18:15 , תורה Mal 2:7 , אהבה Prov 17:9 , תאוה 18:1 ( ל of direct object), חשׁבנות Eccl 7:29 . c. Infinitive Exod 4:24 (J) Jer 26:21 . d. לְ & Infinitive Gen 43:30 ; Exod 2:15 ; 10:11 (JE) Deut 13:11 ; 1Sam 14:4 ; 19:2 , 10 ; 23:10 ; 2Sam 20:19 ; 21:2 ; 1Kin 11:22 , 40 ; Est 2:21 ; 3:6 ; 6:2 ; Psa 37:22 ; Eccl 12:10 ; Zech 6:7 ; 12:9 . 3 seek the face a. of rulers 1Kin 10:24 (= 2Chr 9:23 ) Prov 29:26 . b. of God (from resorting to sacred places) Hosea 5:15 ; 1Chr 16:11 (= Psa 105:4 ) 2Chr 7:14 ; 2Sam 21:1 ; Psa 24:6 ; 27:8 (twice in verse); without מְּנֵי c. יהוה Deut 4:29 ; Zeph 1:6 ; 2:3 ; Hosea 3:5 , 5 ; 5:6 ; Exod 33:7 (J) 1Chr 16:10 (= Psa 105:3 ) 2Chr 11:16 ; 20:4 ; Isa 51:1 ; Prov 28:5 ; Zech 8:21-22 , Jer 50:4 ; אלהים 2Sam 12:16 , compare Ezekiel 8:22; Isa 45:19 ; 65:1 ; 2Chr 15:4 , 15 ; Hosea 7:10 ; Jer 29:13 ; Mal 3:1 ; Psa 40:17 ; 70:5 ; 69:7 ; Dan 9:3 ; י ׳דבר Amos 8:12 ; שׁמך Psa 83:17 . d. followed by Infinitive with לְ , of resort to wizards, but object not expressed Lev 19:34 (H). 4 desire, demand: a. accusative 1Chr 21:3 . b. accusative of thing מִן person Ezek 7:26 ; Dan 1:20 . 5. a. require, exact , accusative of thing מִיַּד person Isa 1:12 ; מִן person Neh 5:12 , accusative of thing 5:18 . b. exact equivalent or penalty for, accusative of thing, מִיַּד person Gen 31:39 ; 43:9 (JE) 1Sam 20:16 ; 2Sam 4:11 ; Ezek 3:18 , 20 ; 33:8 , compare דרשׁ ; no object expressed Josh 22:23 (P). 6 (late) ask, request , accusative of thing Est 2:15 ; עַל of thing Neh 2:4 ; עַל of thing מִן person Est 7:7 ; Ezra 8:23 ; עַל of thing מִלִּפְנֵי person Est 4:8 ; accusative of thing מִן person Dan 1:8 (object clause with אשׁר ), Psa 104:21 ; מִן person 2Chr 20:4 . Pu`al Imperfect יְבֻקַּשׁ Jer 50:20 , ׳וַיְב Est 2:23 ; תֲּבֻקְשִׁי Ezek 26:21 be sought .","rootNote":"a primitive root;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 4 39","keyReferences":["1Chr 4 39","1Chr 14 8","1Chr 16 10","1Chr 16 11","1Chr 21 3","1Kgs 1 2","1Kgs 1 3","1Kgs 2 40"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":225,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 4 39","book":"1Chr","chapter":4,"verse":39,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/בַקֵּ֥שׁ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Vpc"},{"reference":"1Chr 14 8","book":"1Chr","chapter":14,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/בַקֵּ֣שׁ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Vpc"},{"reference":"1Chr 16 10","book":"1Chr","chapter":16,"verse":10,"englishText":"","so